  "description": "In the once peaceful Goat Village, Woo I-ram suddenly became a cursed omen. Shunned and burdened with despair, she made a decision— to end it all by seeking out a wolf to devour her. But there was just one problem… This wolf wasn’t normal. As she embarks on a journey toward what she believes to be the perfect death, I-ram begins to question everything. Can she find a reason to live… in the last place she expected?\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
